{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nl7fv9e","type":"work","title":"震澤編","authors":[{"name":"蔡昇","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bel8"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《震澤編》•八卷","author_info":"明蔡昇撰","summary":"明蔡昇撰。王鏊重修。昇字景東，吳江人。鏊有《史餘》，已著錄。是書首紀五湖七十二山兩洞庭，次石泉古跡，次風俗人物、土產、賦稅，次水利、官署、寺觀、菴廟、雜記，次集詩、集文。前有弘治十八年楊循吉序，稱其“操觚之妙，天機獨運。中間有似《爾雅》者，有似《山海經》者，有似柳子厚諸山水記者，用能繪畫造物，陳諸簡牘”。未免譽過其實。昇書本名《太湖志》，鏊為重修，乃取《禹貢》之語改今名雲。","edition":"浙江巡撫采進本"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《震澤編》八卷","author_info":"明蔡昇撰","summary":"《震澤編》八卷。明蔡昇撰。明 王鏊 重撰 南京圖書館藏明弘治十八年林世遠刻本。","edition":"明 王鏊 重撰 南京圖書館藏明弘治十八年林世遠刻本","volume":"第228冊","section":"史部"}],"juan_count":{"number":8},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02052131","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v3","total_page":438,"paragraph_count":3195,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben-1","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NLG312001075714","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v2","total_page":373,"paragraph_count":982,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-mingwanlikeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NGJ8920939208314","metadata":{"edition":"明萬曆刻本","version":"v2","total_page":373,"paragraph_count":910,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NCL-04003_%E9%9C%87%E6%BE%A4%E7%B7%A8.pdf"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":8}],"measure_info":"八卷","books":["988g3v991l"],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著